### 3. Generate RDF Triples Describing the Scene (Turtle Format)

```turtle
@prefix : <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:Scene1 a :Scene ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :ClearWeather ;
    :hasLightCondition :Daylight .

:ClearWeather a :WeatherCondition ;
    :temperature "25"^^xsd:integer ;
    :condition "Sunny" .

:Daylight a :LightCondition .

:RedCar a :Vehicle ;
    :position "Front" ;
    :approaching :Intersection1 .

:Intersection1 a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :hasTrafficLight :TrafficLight1 ;
    :hasRoadMarkings :RoadMarkings1 .

:TrafficLight1 a :TrafficLight ;
    :signalColor "Red" .

:RoadMarkings1 a :RoadMarkings ;
    :type "LaneLines, PedestrianCrossing" .

:Billboard1 a :Obstacle ;
    :position "AboveRoad" ;
    :type "Advertisement" .

:NoParkingSign a :StreetSign ;
    :position "NearSidewalk" ;
    :type "NoParking" .

:Sidewalk1 a :RoadInfrastructure ;
    :adjacentTo :Tree1 .

:Tree1 a :Obstacle ;
    :potentialOcclusion "Pedestrians, Cyclists" .
```

