### 5. RDF Risk Class Representation

```turtle
:Risk1 a :SafetyRisk ;
    :description "Vehicle approaching red traffic light without stopping" ;
    :severityScore "0.8"^^xsd:float ;
    :riskClass :CollisionRisk .

:Risk2 a :SafetyRisk ;
    :description "Billboards and trees causing visual distractions or occlusions" ;
    :severityScore "0.5"^^xsd:float ;
    :riskClass :DistractionRisk .

:Risk3 a :SafetyRisk ;
